{title: Wada Raha Sanam}
{artist: Khiladi Abhijeet Alka Yagnik Jatin Lalit}
{key: Dm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Dm] [F],        Waada raha sanam
[F] [G],        honge juda na hum
[G] [Dm] [C],        Chaahe na chaahe zamana
[C],        Hamari chahaton ka
[C] [G] [Dm],        mit na sakega fasana
[Dm] [C],        Hamari chahaton ka
[C] [G] [Dm],        mit na sakega fasana
[Dm] [G],        In vaadiyon mein yoon hi
[G] [C],        milte rahenge
[G],        Dil mein wafa ke diye
[G] [C],        jalte rahenge
[C] [F] [G],        Yeh manga hai duaon mein
[G] [C],        Kami na ho wafaon mein
[C] [F] [G],        Rahein teri nigahon mein
[G] [C] [Gm] [F],        Likho na yeh fizaon mein o saajna
[C],        Hamari chahaton ka
[C] [G] [Dm],        mit na sakega fasana
[Dm] [C],        Hamari chahaton ka
[C] [G] [Dm],        mit na sakega fasana
[Dm] [G],        Kaisi udasi tere
[G] [C],        chehre pe chhayi
[G],        Kya baat hai jo teri
[G] [C],        aankh bhar aai
[C] [F] [G],        Dekho to kya nazaare hain
[G] [C],        Tumhari tarah pyare hain
[C] [F] [G],        Hanso na mere liye tum
[G] [C] [Gm] [F],        Sabhi to ye tumhare hai o jaane jaan
[C],        Hamari chahaton ka
[C] [G] [Dm],        mit na sakega fasana
